：「與窋胡治乎？乃者我使諫君也。」參免冠謝曰：「陛下自察聖武孰與高帝？」上曰：「朕乃安敢望先帝乎！」曰：「陛下觀臣能孰與蕭何賢？」上曰：「君似不及也。」參曰：「陛下言之是也。且高帝與蕭何定天下，法令既明，今陛下垂拱，參等守職，遵而勿失，不亦可乎？」惠帝曰：「善。君休矣！」","source_term":"參子窋"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji054-001","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"913_1wz_ofu"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003348"]},{"id":"913_1wz_ofu_AA","label":"奇（曹相國世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"奇","mention_ids":["c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0036"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p017","quote":"奇"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","source_id":"s-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p017","quote":"平陽侯窋，高后時為御史大夫。孝文帝立，免為侯。立二十九年卒，謚為靜侯。子奇代侯，立七年卒，謚為簡侯。子時代侯。時尚平陽公主，生子襄。時病癘，歸國。立二十三年卒，謚夷侯。子襄代侯。襄尚衛長公主，生子宗。立十六年卒，謚為共侯。子宗代侯。征和二年中，宗坐太子死，國除。","source_term":"子奇代侯"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji054-002","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"913_1wz_ofu_A"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p003351"]},{"id":"913_1wz_ofu_AAA","label":"時（曹相國世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"時","mention_ids":["c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0051","c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0055","c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0066"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0051","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p017","quote":"時"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0055","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p017","quote":"時"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:m017-0066","chapter_id":"c-shiji-054-cao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-054-cao:p017","quote":"時"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","